WEBVTT

00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:07.370
Designated to protect the Mana Tree, source of all life against the forces of evil,

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:10.070
The people of Illusia need your help.

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:12.690
You won't be alone in this adventure.

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:16.090
Gather up, up to 4 players in the local network.

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:19.640
Children of Mana, the RPG multiplayer on DS.
